compio-driver 0.12.5: skip a stale event of a polling batch rather than leave the batch, losing every event after it.
Upstream's fix of compio-rs/compio#1119, merged as PR #1121 (commit 5666663, 2026-10-30), in no release yet.

--- a/src/sys/driver/poll/mod.rs
+++ b/src/sys/driver/poll/mod.rs
@@ -481,7 +481,7 @@
                     Some(OpType::Fd(_)) => {
                         // FIXME: This should not happen
                         let Some(fd) = op.extra().as_poll().next_fd() else {
-                            return Ok(());
+                            continue;
                         };
                         drop(op);
                         this.poll_one(event, fd)?;
